   "vigor": "OUT OF 200, not out of a max field. It reports {value, scale_max, rest_threshold}. Resting alone stops awarding it at 80; everything above that has to be eaten. Reading it like health is a mistake this repository has made more than once.",
   "level": "A character's LEVEL is its maximum health. There is no separate field.",
   "equipment": "What is WORN is plUsing and is the server's own word. What is CARRIED is the inventory and is a different list."
  },
  "provenance": "Every block says where it came from. `live` means the broker answered for a character in game at capture time; `remembered` means it came from substrate/abilities, which survives the session."
